msgstr "Convert account to Solis-ID account"

#: leaders/templates/leaders/convert.html:23
msgid "leaders:convert:text"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you want to convert {}'s account to a Solis-ID based account? "
"<br/> This will remove any set password and require the user to use their UU "
"credentials! The user won't be automatically informed of this change."

