msgstr "Deleting leader"

#: leaders/templates/leaders/delete.html:23
msgid "leaders:delete:text"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {} as leader? Any experiment where he/she is "
"the main leader will probably experience unexpected or undefined behaviour. "
"You might want to disable his/her leader profile instead, which will appear "
"to the leader as if their account has been deleted."

#: leaders/templates/leaders/delete.html:26
msgid "leaders:delete:cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

#: leaders/templates/leaders/delete.html:29
